<title>ITALY: CYCLING-ZABEL WINS MILAN-SAN REMO.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-ZABEL WINS MILAN-SAN REMO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN REMO, Italy 1997-03-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Erik Zabel of Germany won the 294-km Milan-San Remo classic, opening race of the World Cup series, on Saturday.</p>
<p>Italians Alberto Elli and Biagio Conte were second and third. All three clocked six hours 57 minutes 47 seconds.</p>
